<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Novus posts record quarterly revenue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Novus posts record quarterly revenue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil and gas producer Novus Petroleum Ltd said on Thursday it lifted sales revenue to a record A$33.1 million in the final quarter of 1996, reflecting higher world oil prices.</p>
<p>The record figure compared with A$28.9 million in the fourth quarter of 1995 and A$26.9 million in the September 1996 quarter.</p>
<p>Novus said net production for the December quarter remained steady with the preceding quarter at 2.14 million barrels of oil equivalent.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
